<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Southwest Air cuts EPS view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Southwest Air cuts EPS view.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Julius Maldutis reduced his earnings estimates for Southwest Airlines Co to $0.48 per share from $0.56 for the third quarter, and to $0.34 from $0.42 for the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>-- cited higher-than-expected fuel costs and air-fare sale.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/4 to 22-1/8 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
